@@ -1,3 +1,7 @@
+STAR 2.7.11c --- unreleased
+===========================================
+* Issue #NNNN: Fixed the strand of Aligned.toTranscriptome.out.bam records and of STARsolo stranded Gene/GeneFull/GeneFull_Ex50pAS counting for transcripts and genes whose GTF strand is undefined ('.'): the strand was inverted for the transcriptome BAM and such genes received no counts with --soloStrand Forward/Reverse. Undefined-strand transcripts are now treated as '+' in the transcriptome BAM and accept reads from both strands in STARsolo, as --quantMode GeneCounts already did. New regression test extras/tests/scripts/testStrandlessTranscript.sh.
